 and each block's stonework is offset. The walls were also too bright - that has been toned down- Spell rings and sigils are light now. The flat constant-width outlines are gone, replaced by soft glo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-20T17:17:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010499447","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:24:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5096100-1843481262696928","game_id":"steam-5096100","kind":"announcement","title":"AI Link added","summary":"Today's update adds AI Link. Enable it in Settings and the game will talk to an external AI app, on your PC only.Off (default) — nothing is connected; exactly as beforeCommentary — the app hears what happens; you playAI Plays — the AI picks your squad, placement, rewards and battle movesOnly the text of events and options (in the game's language) is sent, and the app replies with a number and a line of dialogue. All traffic stays on 127.0.0.1: nothing leaves your machine, and no personal data is","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-12T04:30:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262696928","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:24:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5096100":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-25T22:53:41Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-25T22:53:41Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5096100":"2026-10-25T22:53:41Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5096100":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-25T22:53:41Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-25T22:53:41Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5168480":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-25T22:53:41Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-25T22:53:41Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}}}
